<h2>Questions from Terre Haute property owners</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>Will my policy pay to restore historic wood siding?</summary><div class="a"><p>It depends on the policy and on whether comparable material is reasonably necessary to restore the home to like kind and quality. We document the existing materials so that question can be answered on the facts.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do code upgrades apply to older rentals?</summary><div class="a"><p>Often, when walls and systems are opened. Ordinance or law coverage, if your policy includes it, may pay part of the cost.</p></div></details></div>
